``` LF-02 | License Warnings and Violations: Which Day, Which Pool
    Splunk Administrator Field Manual - Gaurav Malik

    Use case: The license manager is showing warnings, or searches are blocked
    for a license violation; identify the days and pools that went over quota
    and how close the stack is to a violation.
    Run on: SH for the history, LM for the active messages.
    Query: Main query
    If this returns nothing, run probes/LF-02-probe.spl,
    probes/LF-02-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
```
index=_internal source=*license_usage.log* type=RolloverSummary earliest=-60d@d
| eval day=strftime(_time - 86400, "%F"),
       used_gb=round(b / 1024 / 1024 / 1024, 2),
       quota_gb=round(stacksz / 1024 / 1024 / 1024, 1),
       over=if(b > stacksz, 1, 0),
       pct=round(100 * b / stacksz, 1)
| sort 0 _time
| streamstats time_window=30d sum(over) as warnings_30d
| table day pool stack used_gb quota_gb pct over warnings_30d
| sort 0 - day
